       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPACCUNL.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT ACCTMAST-FILE ASSIGN TO ACCTMAST
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS AM-ACCT-NUM
               ALTERNATE RECORD KEY IS AM-CUST-ID WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS WS-ACCTMAST-STATUS.
           SELECT EXTRACT-FILE ASSIGN TO ACCTEXT
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS WS-EXTRACT-STATUS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  ACCTMAST-FILE
           RECORD CONTAINS 200 CHARACTERS.
       01  ACCTMAST-REC.
           05  AM-ACCT-NUM                 PIC X(12).
           05  AM-CUST-ID                  PIC X(10).
           05  FILLER                      PIC X(178).
       FD  EXTRACT-FILE
           RECORDING MODE IS F
           BLOCK CONTAINS 0 RECORDS
           RECORD CONTAINS 200 CHARACTERS.
       01  EXTRACT-REC                     PIC X(200).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-FILE-STATUSES.
           05  WS-ACCTMAST-STATUS          PIC X(2).
               88  ACCTMAST-OK             VALUE '00' '02'.
               88  ACCTMAST-EOF            VALUE '10'.
           05  WS-EXTRACT-STATUS           PIC X(2).
               88  EXTRACT-OK              VALUE '00'.

       01  WS-SWITCHES.
           05  WS-ACCTMAST-EOF-SW          PIC X VALUE 'N'.
               88  END-OF-ACCTMAST         VALUE 'Y'.

       01  WS-COUNTERS.
           05  WS-READ-COUNT               PIC S9(9) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
           05  WS-TOTAL-BALANCE            PIC S9(13)V99 COMP-3
                                           VALUE 0.

       01  WS-DISPLAY-COUNT                PIC ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.
       01  WS-DISPLAY-AMOUNT               PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.99-.

           COPY CPACCREC.
           COPY CPACCEXT.
           COPY CPERRWS.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAINLINE.
           PERFORM 1000-INITIALIZE
           PERFORM 2000-UNLOAD-ACCOUNT
               UNTIL END-OF-ACCTMAST
           PERFORM 3000-FINALIZE
           GOBACK.

       1000-INITIALIZE.
           INITIALIZE ERR-AREA
           MOVE 'CPACCUNL' TO ERR-PROGRAM
           MOVE '1000-INITIALIZE' TO ERR-PARAGRAPH
           OPEN INPUT ACCTMAST-FILE
           IF NOT ACCTMAST-OK
               MOVE 'ACCTMAST' TO ERR-FILE
               MOVE WS-ACCTMAST-STATUS TO ERR-STATUS
               PERFORM 9800-OPEN-ERROR
           END-IF
           OPEN OUTPUT EXTRACT-FILE
           IF NOT EXTRACT-OK
               MOVE 'ACCTEXT' TO ERR-FILE
               MOVE WS-EXTRACT-STATUS TO ERR-STATUS
               PERFORM 9800-OPEN-ERROR
           END-IF
           PERFORM 2900-READ-ACCOUNT.

       2000-UNLOAD-ACCOUNT.
           MOVE SPACES TO AX-RECORD
           MOVE ACCT-NUM TO AX-ACCT-NUM
           MOVE ACCT-CUST-ID TO AX-CUST-ID
           MOVE ACCT-PRODUCT TO AX-PRODUCT
           MOVE ACCT-STATUS TO AX-STATUS
           MOVE ACCT-OPEN-DATE TO AX-OPEN-DATE
           MOVE ACCT-CREDIT-LIMIT TO AX-CREDIT-LIMIT
           MOVE ACCT-CASH-LIMIT TO AX-CASH-LIMIT
           MOVE ACCT-CURR-BAL TO AX-CURR-BAL
           MOVE ACCT-CASH-BAL TO AX-CASH-BAL
           MOVE ACCT-CTD-PURCHASES TO AX-CTD-PURCHASES
           MOVE ACCT-CTD-CREDITS TO AX-CTD-CREDITS
           MOVE ACCT-CTD-TXN-COUNT TO AX-CTD-TXN-COUNT
           MOVE ACCT-LAST-POST-DATE TO AX-LAST-POST-DATE
           WRITE EXTRACT-REC FROM AX-RECORD
           IF NOT EXTRACT-OK
               MOVE '2000-UNLOAD-ACCOUNT' TO ERR-PARAGRAPH
               MOVE 'ACCTEXT' TO ERR-FILE
               MOVE WS-EXTRACT-STATUS TO ERR-STATUS
               PERFORM 9810-IO-ERROR
           END-IF
           ADD ACCT-CURR-BAL TO WS-TOTAL-BALANCE
           PERFORM 2900-READ-ACCOUNT.

       2900-READ-ACCOUNT.
           READ ACCTMAST-FILE NEXT RECORD INTO ACCT-RECORD
           EVALUATE TRUE
               WHEN ACCTMAST-OK
                   ADD 1 TO WS-READ-COUNT
               WHEN ACCTMAST-EOF
                   SET END-OF-ACCTMAST TO TRUE
               WHEN OTHER
                   MOVE '2900-READ-ACCOUNT' TO ERR-PARAGRAPH
                   MOVE 'ACCTMAST' TO ERR-FILE
                   MOVE WS-ACCTMAST-STATUS TO ERR-STATUS
                   PERFORM 9810-IO-ERROR
           END-EVALUATE.

       3000-FINALIZE.
           CLOSE ACCTMAST-FILE
                 EXTRACT-FILE
           DISPLAY 'CPACCUNL ACCOUNT MASTER UNLOAD SUMMARY'
           MOVE WS-READ-COUNT TO WS-DISPLAY-COUNT
           DISPLAY '  ACCOUNTS UNLOADED    ' WS-DISPLAY-COUNT
           MOVE WS-TOTAL-BALANCE TO WS-DISPLAY-AMOUNT
           DISPLAY '  TOTAL BALANCE        ' WS-DISPLAY-AMOUNT
           MOVE ZERO TO RETURN-CODE.

       9800-OPEN-ERROR.
           MOVE 'UNABLE TO OPEN FILE' TO ERR-MESSAGE
           PERFORM 9900-ABEND.

       9810-IO-ERROR.
           MOVE 'UNEXPECTED FILE STATUS' TO ERR-MESSAGE
           PERFORM 9900-ABEND.

       9900-ABEND.
           MOVE 16 TO ERR-RETURN-CODE
           CALL 'CPABEND' USING ERR-AREA.
